            "review_title": "Review at Bếp Hoa Cuisine - Nguyễn Tuân",
            "review_text": "Guide45546933939\n1 contribution\n0\nComplaints about slow food\nJul 2026 • Family\nThis afternoon (31/7/2026) I went to dining with my mother in the Kitchen Hoa Nguyen Tuân, my house is nearby so it is very common to eat at this facility, but today I had a bad experience. I don’t know what the restaurant is having, but it comes slow, especially white rice. Crab tiles are added to the dish after about 10 minutes, but the yield of white rice to be eaten with food takes 40-50p before it is brought. I told the staff three times in total and you didn't give yourself a reasonable answer. The dishes were all up without white rice and at the time I was very uncomfortable, I called the hotline for support. Every time we eat a snack or call some garlic, salad can wait, but this afternoon my purpose is to eat rice and food rather than to eat rice, rice up, the food is already cold. I feel really upset and need to reflect.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten July 31, 2026",
