            "review_text": "Phoebe T\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nModern and delicious\nSep 2022\nA lot on the menu that I like to try next time I come by. This was the 4th or 5th time already. For lunch I like a quick meal like fried rice with beef and pickles, or bún riêu/ bún cá. \n\nFor diner we ordered a set of fresh rolls with shrimps and meat, then a set of hotpot. \nHighly recommended for big group of friends and family.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 20, 2022",
